### 1. 管理员登录
POST http://localhost:8101/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userAccount": "admin",
  "userPassword": "12345678"
}

### 2. 管理员建题库
POST http://localhost:8101/api/questionBank/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "管理员的专属题库",
  "description": "测试权限",
  "picture": "https://www.mianshiya.com/logo.png"
}

### 1. 注册普通用户（如果已存在可直接跳过）
POST http://localhost:8101/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userAccount": "normal_user",
  "userPassword": "12345678",
  "checkPassword": "12345678"
}

### 2. 普通用户登录
POST http://localhost:8101/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userAccount": "normal_user",
  "userPassword": "12345678"
}

### 3. 普通用户尝试建题库
POST http://localhost:8101/api/questionBank/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "普通用户想造反",
  "description": "测试权限",
  "picture": "https://www.mianshiya.com/logo.png"
}


